1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,460
(Past Raj:)Okay, do you have an opinion
about everything?

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,540
(Leonard(voice off):)Yes.

3
00:00:05,334 --> 00:00:07,664
(Past Howard:)You just assume you're always right?

4
00:00:08,504 --> 00:00:10,134
(Past Sheldon:)It's not an assumption.

5
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:13,467
(Past Sheldon:)-Change seats with me.
-Why?

6
00:00:13,634 --> 00:00:16,384
(Past Sheldon:)I don't like this spot.
I have to keep turning my head.

7
00:00:17,054 --> 00:00:18,384
(Past Leonard:)Fine.

8
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:21,225
(Past Leonard:)It's time for Babylon 5.

9
00:00:21,391 --> 00:00:23,811
(Past Sheldon:)We don't watch Babylon 5
in this apartment.

10
00:00:23,977 --> 00:00:27,017
(Penny:)-Why not?
-Because no one likes Babylon 5.

11
00:00:27,189 --> 00:00:28,609
(Past Leonard:)-I like it.
-Me too.

12
00:00:28,774 --> 00:00:30,814
(Past Howard:)-So do I.
-There you go, three against one.

13
00:00:30,984 --> 00:00:33,324
(Past Sheldon:)They don't get a vote. It's one against one.

14
00:00:33,487 --> 00:00:37,867
(Past Sheldon:)And according to the roommate agreement,
all ties will be settled by me.

15
00:00:38,909 --> 00:00:42,409
(Past Leonard:)-But I said no to that.
-And I said yes.

16
00:00:43,038 --> 00:00:45,038
(Past Sheldon:)And I settle all ties.

17
00:00:48,836 --> 00:00:51,126
(Past Sheldon:)-Change seats with me.
-Why?

18
00:00:51,296 --> 00:00:53,046
(Past Sheldon:)There's a draft on my neck over here.

19
00:00:53,215 --> 00:00:54,755
(Past Howard:)So I get the draft?

20
00:00:54,925 --> 00:00:57,055
(Past Sheldon:)You're protected by your turtleneck.

21
00:00:59,179 --> 00:01:01,019
(Past Leonard:)Fine.

